        "id": 20107,
        "name": "BurnJ",
        "username": "BurnJ",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/ee7513/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2020-07-26T17:08:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I am working on a character that is known for its uncanny and unparalleled&nbsp;regeneration abilties.</p>\n<p>I had a question regarding Major Regneration from Athletics, and Major Regeneration from Self Control. They both do the same thing \"Hinder yourself; use Min die; Recover using Max+Mid die. However, one requires you to Hinder yourself&nbsp;with Vitality, and the other with [Power]</p>\n<p>1) Does taking both of these make my Regneration capabilties any better, or will I find myself only using Vitality&nbsp;or [Power] when Hindering myself? With no real choice other the asthetic, die size,&nbsp;or perhaps situationaly. Can I even take both if it mattered?</p>\n<p>If not, Ill most likley end up picking one of them, and perhaps going with Ressurection.</p>\n<p>Thanks!</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:54:04.704Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 2,
        "reads": 6,
        "readers_count": 5,
        "score": 6.2,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 20107,
        "topic_slug": "taking-both-major-regeneration-red-powers",
        "display_username": "BurnJ",
        "primary_group_name": null,
        "flair_name": null,
        "flair_url": null,
        "flair_bg_color": null,
        "flair_color": null,
        "flair_group_id": null,
        "badges_granted": [],
        "version": 1,
        "can_edit": false,
        "can_delete": false,
        "can_recover": false,
        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>I am working on a character that is known for its uncanny and unparalleled&nbsp;regeneration abilties.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I had a question regarding Major Regneration from Athletics, and Major Regeneration from Self Control. They both do the same thing \"Hinder yourself; use Min die; Recover using Max+Mid die. However, one requires you to Hinder yourself&nbsp;with Vitality, and the other with [Power]</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1) Does taking both of these make my Regneration capabilties any better, or will I find myself only using Vitality&nbsp;or [Power] when Hindering myself? With no real choice other the asthetic, die size,&nbsp;or perhaps situationaly. Can I even take both if it mattered?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If not, Ill most likley end up picking one of them, and perhaps going with Ressurection.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Thanks!</p>",
