      {
        "id": 232998,
        "name": "aramis",
        "username": "aramis",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/aramis/{size}/1871_2.png",
        "created_at": "2020-08-15T09:03:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Doubling up an ability, any ability, really is a waste of slots most of the time.</p>\n<p>If you want to be able to major heal better, take a green or yellow self boost... because your green and yellow are still options when you're in red... so boost self, then next turn, heal self.</p>",
